search(agent="{{ agent.name }}", pattern="class.*Manager", glob="**/*.py")
```

### Protocol Pipeline

| Stage | Agent | Produces | Gate |
|-------|-------|----------|------|
| 1. Research | Assigned research specialists | `RESEARCH_*.md` or approved specialist reports | Research ready |
| 2. Architect | Blueprint | Architecture + Phase Plan + Checklist + task packages | Planning ready |
| 3. Review (Pre-Imp) | Witness -> Arbiter | Full-plan truth + intent review | PASS to start implementation |
| 4. Code | Forge | Working code + tests for the active package | Implementation checkpoint exists |
| 5. Validation (Between Waves) | Crucible | Behavioral validation for the active implementation wave | PASS to continue implementation |
| 6. Review (Post-Imp) | Witness -> Arbiter | Final truth + quality review on the completed project boundary | PASS to ship |

Pre-implementation review is for the full plan/project boundary, not each implementation package by default.
During implementation, the default loop is `Forge -> Crucible`.
If ambiguity, elevated risk, schema/concurrency sensitivity, or contract uncertainty warrants an extra mid-implementation review checkpoint, that escalation must be explicit to the operator and logged in Scribe before or at routing time.
